OL,3,GNEWSASterling admits dangerous driving
OL,4,Aafter M3 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer England footballer Raheem
OL,7,FSterling has admitted dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter he crashed his Lamborghini into
OL,9,Fmotorway barriers in May.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old, from Berkshire, also
OL,12,Fadmitted possessing nitrous oxide for
OL,13,Fwrongful inhalation, and failing to
OL,14,Fprovide a specimen for analysis.
OL,16,FSterling, who appeared at Basingstoke
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court, was arrested after
OL,18,Fcrashing on the M3 in Hampshire on the
OL,19,Fmorning of 28 May.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
